# The admin panel is ONE 840 KB file and it is LF.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, and until now
# nothing pinned this file's line endings. So an ordinary `git checkout --
# packages/admin/index.html` — the reflex for undoing an edit — rewrote all
# 13 838 line endings to CRLF and grew the file by ~7 KB. It has happened at
# least twice, and the second time it silently destroyed an agent's work
# during a revert probe: the file "looked unmodified" while being a different
# 864 432 bytes.
#
# The damage is quiet because nothing fails. The panel still parses, the tests
# still pass, and the diff is the entire file — which is unreviewable, so a
# real change hiding inside it would not be seen.
#
# Deliberately narrow. This pins the one file that has demonstrably been
# corrupted rather than declaring a line-ending policy for the whole tree:
# app/lib/l10n/l10n.dart is CRLF on purpose and several tests assert it, so a
# blanket `* text=auto` here would be a much larger and riskier change than
# the problem warrants.
packages/admin/index.html text eol=lf
